description:
Chapter Home, a home and kitchen consumer brand company, has raised Rs 63 crore through a mix of equity and debt from Bessemer Venture Partners, Stride Ventures, influencer Tanmay Bhat and a group of family offices.&nbsp;
The funding round values the company at close to Rs 1,000 crore.
